@DesignPatternsDemo_HostAddress = http://localhost:5097
@contentType = application/json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Products API — End-to-End HTTP Test Script
# Run these requests in order to exercise the full CRUD flow.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [1] GET all products (initially empty)
GET {{DesignPatternsDemo_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### [2] POST — Create product Alpha
# @name createAlpha
POST {{DesignPatternsDemo_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Product Alpha",
  "description": "First demo product",
  "price": 29.99,
  "category": "Demo",
  "stockQuantity": 100
}

###

### [3] POST — Create product Beta
# @name createBeta
POST {{DesignPatternsDemo_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Product Beta",
  "description": "Second demo product",
  "price": 49.99,
  "category": "Demo",
  "stockQuantity": 50
}

###

### [4] GET all products (should now contain Alpha and Beta)
GET {{DesignPatternsDemo_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### [5] GET product by ID — replace {productId} with a real GUID from step [2]
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{DesignPatternsDemo_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### [6] PUT — Update product by ID
PUT {{DesignPatternsDemo_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Product Alpha (Updated)",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "price": 34.99,
  "category": "Demo",
  "stockQuantity": 90
}

###

### [7] GET updated product by ID (verify changes)
GET {{DesignPatternsDemo_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### [8] DELETE product by ID
DELETE {{DesignPatternsDemo_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}

###

### [9] GET deleted product — expect 404
GET {{DesignPatternsDemo_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### [10] GET all products (only Beta should remain)
GET {{DesignPatternsDemo_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: {{contentType}}

###
